  m_DisplayName: The Siege of Moscow in 1812 1912
  m_Prompt: "Ilya Repin\u2019s late canvas of Napoleon\u2019s 1812 campaign: smoke,
    ruin, and the abandoned city as the Grande Arm\xE9e reaches Moscow. Painted in
    1912, a century after the war, it treats the siege as a national memory rather
    than a battle panorama."
