    crowd greets the Tsar\u2019s October Manifesto \u2014 flags, students, workers
    \u2014 while the fallen figure reminds you that the \u2018constitution day\u2019
    was also a day of blood. One of Repin\u2019s most political late works."
  m_PromptByLanguage: []
  m_SpeechMode: 3
  m_PauseVideoWhenCaptionShown: 1
