  m_DisplayName: Unexpected Visitors 1884-1888
  m_Prompt: "Ilya Repin, They Did Not Expect Him (\u041D\u0435 \u0436\u0434\u0430\u043B\u0438),
    1884\u20131888. A political exile steps back into a quiet apartment; shock, joy,
    and fear freeze on every face. The empty doorway and the mother\u2019s gesture
    make the return feel both intimate and historic."
