  m_DisplayName: St. Nicholas Saves Three Innocents from Death 1888
  m_Prompt: "Ilya Repin, St Nicholas of Myra Saves Three Innocents from Death, 1888.
    The saint seizes the executioner\u2019s sword at the last instant; the condemned
    kneel, the crowd surges. Repin turns a medieval miracle into a modern drama of
    unjust power and sudden mercy."
