  m_DisplayName: St. Nicholas Saves Three Innocents from Death 1890
  m_Prompt: "Ilya Repin, later version (c. 1890) of St Nicholas Saves Three Innocents
    from Death. Same legend as the 1888 canvas: the bishop of Myra stopping a wrongful
    beheading. Repin reworked light, crowding, and the saint\u2019s lunge to make
    the miracle feel even more sudden."
  m_PromptByLanguage: []
  m_SpeechMode: 3
