  m_Prompt: "Ilya Repin, Ivan the Terrible and His Son Ivan, 16 November 1581 (1885).
    After a fatal blow, the tsar cradles the tsarevich; blood, horror, and a father\u2019s
    collapse fill the dark chamber. One of the most famous \u2014 and once censored
    \u2014 pictures in the Tretyakov Gallery."
